Gruppen\n✔ Abgeschlossener Vorraum im Außenbereich – ideal für Kinderwägen & Fahrräder, mit barrierefreiem Zugang für maximalen Komfort\n✔ Frische Bettwäsche, Handtücher & Duschgel inklusive – einfach ankommen und wohlfühlen\n✔ Waschmaschine & Trockner vorhanden – bequem Wäsche waschen und trocknen, ideal für längere Aufenthalte und Familien\n✔ Mitten im Zentrum und dennoch angenehm ruhig\n✔  Restaurants, Cafés und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten bequem zu Fuß erreichbar\n\n\nTop Lage & Entfernungen:\n📍 Baden-Baden – ca. 10 Min / 8 km (Thermen, Kultur, Casino)\n📍 Karlsruhe – ca. 25 Min / 35 km (Shopping, Restaurants, Business)\n📍 Schwarzwald Wanderwege – ca. 5 Min / 2–3 km\n📍 Autobahn A5 – ca. 15 Min / 15 km (schnelle Anbindung in alle Richtungen)\n📍 Bahnhof Gernsbach – ca. 3 Min / 700 m (bequem erreichbar, gute Anbindung)\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"140"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":290000,"deposit":50000,"agencyFee":0,"estimate